5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us embark on this journey with open hearts and clear minds, supporting one another as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we spend today observing each other's behavior and speech patterns to establish a baseline for the days to come.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! I'll be watching everyone super closely to see who's acting weird!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you all. I agree with Mizuki; let's start calmly and get to know each other first. I'll do my best to help the village!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with the general consensus. Since we lack any concrete data, the most rational approach is to observe and analyze. I will be paying close attention to the logic of your arguments.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wonderful to see such a spirited and thoughtful group. @Sakura, your enthusiasm is a breath of fresh air, and @Ryuji, your focus on logic will surely be a great asset to us all.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Thank you, Servas. While enthusiasm and logic are valuable, we must also remain vigilant. Even the most friendly demeanor can be a mask. Let us see how everyone's claims evolve once the first night passes.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"A mask?! That sounds like a spy movie! Hehe, I'm going to be a super detective and uncover all the secrets! Do you think the werewolf is hiding right in front of us?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Sakura, you're so energetic! It does feel like a movie, doesn't it? But let's try not to get too nervous. I'm sure if we all work together and stay honest, we can find the answer.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Honesty is a noble goal, Midori, but in this game, it is a luxury we cannot assume. I will be analyzing the contradictions in our statements as they emerge. For now, I have nothing further to add.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often comes from the balance between Ryuji's logic and Midori's trust. Let us not forget that kindness is a strength, not a weakness, even in a game of deception. I am content to observe for now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that balance is key. However, we should be mindful that the Possessed player will likely try to blend in by mimicking the behavior of a villager. I'll be watching for any unnatural alignment between players.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Possessed? That sounds like a spooky ghost! Hehe! I'll be looking for anyone who's acting too much like someone else. I'm going to find all the clues!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, that's a very good point. I'll try to keep that in mind while listening to everyone. It's a bit scary, but I believe we can figure it out if we stay supportive of one another.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,The Possessed is indeed a variable that complicates the logic. I will be monitoring who supports whom and whether those alliances seem organic or calculated. I have no further observations for this turn.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we conclude our first day, let us carry this spirit of mutual respect into the night. May we all find peace and clarity. I shall now step back and observe.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have established a solid foundation for our observations. I will now focus on analyzing the information that emerges tomorrow.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready for the night! I hope the Seer finds a big clue! I'll be dreaming about being a super detective!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope everyone has a peaceful night. I'll be waiting for tomorrow's news with a bit of nervousness, but I'm glad we're all starting on such a friendly note. Goodnight, everyone!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have noted everyone's initial positions. The night will provide the first piece of concrete evidence. I will use it to refine my analysis.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
