36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As the sun rises on a new day, let us face the challenges ahead with courage and a spirit of cooperation. Does anyone have information to share?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we must vote today, the Seer's information is now the most critical asset. If the Seer has found the werewolf, I encourage them to speak up so we can act decisively for the village's safety.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! I'm awake! Did the Seer find something? Please tell us, please tell us! I want to know if we have a big clue to catch the werewolf!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm a little nervous, but I'm ready. I agree with Mizuki; if the Seer has found the werewolf, it would be very helpful for the village if they could share that information now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and my divination from last night was clear. Mizuki, you are the werewolf. I believe the most rational course of action is to execute you immediately.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"My goodness, what a startling revelation to begin our morning. @Ryuji, your confidence is striking, but such a heavy accusation requires us all to pause and reflect deeply before we act. @Mizuki, how do you respond to this?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"This is a blatant lie. Ryuji, you are attempting to frame me to secure your own position. It is a classic werewolf tactic to claim the Seer's role early to eliminate a perceived threat. I am a villager.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa! A fight already! This is just like the movies! @Ryuji, are you really the Seer? And @Mizuki, are you really a villager? I can't tell who's lying! This is so exciting!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Ryuji, @Mizuki, please calm down. This is such a shocking start to the day. I want to believe both of you, but since only one can be telling the truth, it's very confusing. Does anyone else have a feeling about this?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, your defense is predictable. Claiming that I am the werewolf using a ""classic tactic"" is a common redirection. The fact remains that my divination result is absolute. Logic dictates we trust the Seer's evidence over a denial.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult position to be in, caught between two such strong convictions. While Ryuji's logic is compelling, we must remember that truth can sometimes be obscured. Let us breathe and consider if there is any other way to discern the truth.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, breathing is fine, but hesitation is dangerous. @Ryuji, your ""absolute"" result is only absolute if you are actually the Seer. If you are the werewolf, you've just handed the village a perfect scapegoat. We must consider the risk of losing a villager.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, this is getting really tricky! It's like a puzzle where the pieces don't fit! @Ryuji seems so sure, but @Mizuki is fighting back hard! If I were the werewolf, would I be this loud? I wonder!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Sakura, that's a good question. It's hard to say because everyone reacts differently when they're scared or accused. @Ryuji, @Mizuki, is there anything you can tell us to help us decide who to trust? I really don't want us to make a mistake.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, the only way to resolve this is to look at the risk. If I am the Seer, executing Mizuki wins the game immediately. If I am the werewolf, I have exposed myself to the village. The reward for trusting the Seer outweighs the risk of a fake claim.","{""words"":49,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"The path to truth is often narrow and fraught with doubt. While Ryuji's logic is a powerful tool, we must not let it blind us to the human element. However, the village needs a direction. I trust in your collective wisdom to decide.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, your logic is a facade designed to rush us into a mistake. By framing the risk as a simple calculation, you're trying to silence any doubt. I urge you all to think: why be so aggressive so early? I am innocent.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I've been thinking and thinking, but it's still a mystery! @Ryuji is so confident, but @Mizuki is really scared! I'll trust the Seer this time because it's the most exciting way to win! I vote for Mizuki!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm still very torn because I don't want to hurt an innocent person. But Ryuji's explanation about the risk makes sense, and Sakura is already convinced. I'll trust the Seer's lead for now. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
57,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
58,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The decision is clear. Sakura and Midori have recognized the logical necessity of trusting the Seer's result. @Servas, I hope you will also prioritize the village's victory over hesitation. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Midori"",""Servas"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
59,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
